  "title": "Black Stone Minerals, L.P. Reports Second Quarter Results",
  "summary": "Black Stone Minerals, L.P. (NYSE: BSM) (\"Black Stone Minerals,\" \"Black Stone,\" or \"the Partnership\") today announces its financial and operating results for the second quarter of 2026. Financial and Operational Highlights Net income for the second quarter was $106.4 million, and Adjusted EBITDA for the quarter totaled $91.3 million. Distributable cash flow was $80.4 million for the second quarter. Mineral and royalty production for the second quarter of 2026 equaled 32.5 MBoe/d, a decrease of 9%",
